description:
Design a D flip-flop with enable (CE) and asynchronous set (S) functionality. The output Q is updated on the rising edge of the clock (C) when the enable signal (CE) is high. If S is asserted, the flip-flop resets the output Q to LOW regardless of the input D. When CE is active and S is not asserted, the flip-flop captures the value of D on the clock edge.
module top_module(
    input D, C, CE, S,
    output reg Q
);

