description:
Design a clock-driven module that extracts a subset of bits from a predefined constant based on a 7-bit input. The output `out` is derived from specific bits of the constant, indexed by the input, while the `mask` output generates a 4-bit mask indicating whether various thresholds (from 12 to 15) are met based on the adjusted input value. This module can serve as a decoder or bit-selector, providing both the extracted value and a corresponding mask to facilitate further processing or conditional logic in a digital system.
