description:
Design a 4-bit up counter that increments its value on every positive clock edge when the `up` signal is high. The counter resets to zero when the `reset` signal is asserted low. Additionally, the module includes an output signal `countReached` that indicates when the counter reaches the value of 8 (binary 1000), signifying this condition through the appropriate logical condition on the most significant bit along with the state of the lower bits.
