Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build a 4-bit binary counter with enable and asynchronous reset, which stops at a maximum value of 9 (1001).
// (1) enable: Enables the counter. Active high.
// (2) reset: Asynchronous reset of the counter. Active high.
